      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>En español, casi todos los sustantivos tienen género: <strong>masculinos</strong> o <strong>femeninos</strong>. Algunas reglas son claras (<em>-o = masculino, -a = femenino</em>), pero otras son trampas: <em>el problema</em>, <em>la mano</em>, <em>el clima</em>.</p><p class="button-wrapper" data-attrs="{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://dailypushes.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}" data-component-name="ButtonCreateButton"><a class="button primary" href="https://dailypushes.substack.com/subscribe?"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" target="_blank" href="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1673822585299-d6f6a0a1ee5f?crop=entropy&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;fit=max&amp;fm=jpg&amp;ixid=M3wzMDAzMzh8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxfHxtYXNjdWxpbmUlMjBmZW1lbnxlbnwwfHx8fDE3Njk1MTU0NDF8MA&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0&amp;q=80&amp;w=1080" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1673822585299-d6f6a0a1ee5f?crop=entropy&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;fit=max&amp;fm=jpg&amp;ixid=M3wzMDAzMzh8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxfHxtYXNjdWxpbmUlMjBmZW1lbnxlbnwwfHx8fDE3Njk1MTU0NDF8MA&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0&amp;q=80&amp;w=1080 424w, https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1673822585299-d6f6a0a1ee5f?crop=entropy&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;fit=max&amp;fm=jpg&amp;ixid=M3wzMDAzMzh8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxfHxtYXNjdWxpbmUlMjBmZW1lbnxlbnwwfHx8fDE3Njk1MTU0NDF8MA&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0&amp;q=80&amp;w=1080 848w, https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1673822585299-d6f6a0a1ee5f?crop=entropy&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;fit=max&amp;fm=jpg&amp;ixid=M3wzMDAzMzh8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxfHxtYXNjdWxpbmUlMjBmZW1lbnxlbnwwfHx8fDE3Njk1MTU0NDF8MA&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0&amp;q=80&amp;w=1080 1272w, https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1673822585299-d6f6a0a1ee5f?crop=entropy&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;fit=max&amp;fm=jpg&amp;ixid=M3wzMDAzM